        "payload": {
          "content": {
            "parts": [
              {
                "text": "### 🏛️ Goal Restatement\n\nA two-storey U-shaped structural wireframe with ground and upper floor perimeter walls, floor slabs reserving a 1.2 m × 7.2 m west-wing stairwell void, and an open southern courtyard.\n\n---\n\n### 📐 Authored Structural Wireframe\n\nThe design was authored in the Sketch Architectural workspace across two verified batches, advancing the design revision to **4**:\n\n```mindmap\nAB-01 Courtyard Learning Centre\n  Ground Level (0 mm, h: 3600 mm)\n    Walls (8 exterior perimeter segments)\n    Ground Floor Slab (250 mm, top @ 0 mm)\n  Upper Floor Level (3600 mm, h: 3600 mm)\n    Walls (8 exterior perimeter segments)\n    Upper Floor Slabs (6 sub-slabs around stair void)\n    Stairwell Void (1.2 m x 7.2 m open)\n  Roof Level (7200 mm)\n    Requires 3 convex roof zones (blocked by tool recovery lock)\n```\n\n#### 1. Levels and Storey Heights\n* **Ground Level** (`aa08d0a9-6bee-42c1-ba21-475591e50f8a`): Elevation `0 mm`, storey height updated from `2700 mm` to `3600 mm`.\n* **Upper Floor Level** (`0e44a7e8-205f-4329-928f-6104dcfbab06`): Created at elevation `3600 mm`, storey height `3600 mm`.\n\n#### 2. Ground Floor Envelope & Slab\n* **Exterior Boundary Walls** (height `3600 mm`, forming the 24.0 m × 18.0 m overall footprint):\n  * West outer wall: `1cdcd3f5-95d0-41ab-874e-052346a8c206` (length 18.0 m, from `[0, 0]` to `[0, 18000]`)\n  * North outer wall: `85a4264d-79d6-4067-af4e-e435b8a4f6bd` (length 24.0 m, from `[0, 18000]` to `[24000, 18000]`)\n  * East outer wall: `88efb101-891c-4fae-a5b6-55868510a45b` (length 18.0 m, from `[24000, 18000]` to `[24000, 0]`)\n  * East wing south wall: `025fa2f5-e98c-4a5d-aa7b-4f8aee189e48` (length 6.0 m, from `[24000, 0]` to `[18000, 0]`)\n  * East courtyard wall: `ff500bb2-66ff-4fdb-b91e-100b4003d84a` (length 12.0 m, from `[18000, 0]` to `[18000, 12000]`)\n  * North courtyard wall: `9082bb9a-34f0-4c13-a1bb-e0099b029c9c` (length 12.0 m, from `[18000, 12000]` to `[6000, 12000]`)\n  * West courtyard wall: `8e49ca45-1559-4f1f-af84-56d735ba0485` (length 12.0 m, from `[6000, 12000]` to `[6000, 0]`)\n  * West wing south wall: `0390bfae-83f6-4452-81c0-2d7c3d093e62` (length 6.0 m, from `[6000, 0]` to `[0, 0]`)\n* **Ground Floor Slab** (`c406a6da-d4d8-4a57-8e7b-1f827b420ba2`): Thickness `250 mm`, top at `0 mm`, covering the full 8-point U-shaped footprint without encroaching on the courtyard.\n\n#### 3. Upper Floor Envelope & Supported Slab Geometry\n* **Exterior Boundary Walls** (height `3600 mm` on level `0e44a7e8-205f-4329-928f-6104dcfbab06`):\n  * Upper west outer wall: `2c1bf6b7-508b-40ef-8591-1eef3f88e490`\n  * Upper north outer wall: `ba04391d-6ecf-4c08-88c3-9b4146ca2ce1`\n  * Upper east outer wall: `cc8123af-0674-426d-8308-6a27e072763c`\n  * Upper east south wall: `3fd4265a-d63b-430a-9bf4-751ba58fcfe4`\n  * Upper east courtyard wall: `4be97164-1a5e-4d06-bf17-8e13e296b859`\n  * Upper north courtyard wall: `5b7e6f8f-68b9-4c40-a4a3-b41e44ed6f35`\n  * Upper west courtyard wall: `99ae69be-d071-46c2-a15d-87525e727d38`\n  * Upper west south wall: `4fd9a9e1-94de-426d-b507-d51d6fff31fe`\n* **Upper Floor Slab System** (Thickness `250 mm`, top at `3600 mm`):\n  * Because the architectural engine does not support internal cutout/hole loops within a single slab primitive, the upper floor was constructed from 6 contiguous, non-overlapping rectangular slabs framing the stairwell:\n    * East Wing Slab (`ac19ab49-1ceb-402a-8cdf-f78a8882c648`): `[18000, 0]` to `[24000, 18000]`\n    * North Wing Central Slab (`b673c660-0560-4a6e-9265-f000024b23d1`): `[6000, 12000]` to `[18000, 18000]`\n    * West Wing North Slab (`49de96f1-38b8-4e4c-9626-ffd19921209e`): `[0, 9600]` to `[6000, 18000]`\n    * West Wing South Landing Slab (`a258fb62-34f6-432d-89eb-99852ac4e5cb`): `[0, 0]` to `[6000, 2400]`\n    * West Wing Flank Slab (`9c79e8db-7ea6-415f-8568-c299195bf631`): `[0, 2400]` to `[2400, 9600]`\n    * East Wing Flank Slab (`dc03395e-4209-40d5-98c7-2296b2362210`): `[3600, 2400]` to `[6000, 9600]`\n* **Stairwell Opening Verification**:\n  * Bounded between `X: [2400, 3600]` and `Y: [2400, 9600]`.\n  * Dimensions: exactly **1.2 m wide** × **7.2 m long**.\n  * Clearances: **2.4 m** south landing clearance, **2.4 m** north corridor landing before the courtyard junction (**8.4 m** to the northern outer wall), and **2.4 m** lateral walkways on both flanks.\n\n---\n\n### 🏢 Unsupported Items and Platform Failure Report\n\n1. **Concave Roof Geometry Not Supported by Single Entity**:\n   * Attempting to place a single U-shaped flat roof failed validation with the engine error: *\"Split a concave roof into convex roof zones.\"*\n   * The architectural tool requires roof primitives to be strictly convex. To cover the U footprint without covering the courtyard, the roof must be submitted as three separate convex rectangular zones (West wing: 6 m × 18 m, North link: 12 m × 6 m, East wing: 6 m × 18 m).\n\n2. **Native Floor Slab Cutouts**:\n   * X-Ray slab primitives do not accept inner boundary holes. Subdividing the floor into a multi-slab assembly was required to reserve the 1.2 m × 7.2 m stair opening.\n\n3. **Tool Recovery Lock**:\n   * Following the rejected concave roof operation, subsequent actions encountered a platform persistence lock: *\"An earlier tool has no durable outcome. Reconcile its saved state before another action.\"*\n   * As a result, committing the 3 split convex roof zones, executing `show_design_in_model`, and capturing the 3D viewport could not be completed this turn. Per safety guidelines, no synthetic raster substitutions or unverified completion claims are produced.",
